{"status":"ready","content":"First, find the mean:\r\n\r\nSum = 9 + 14 + 5 + 4 + (-20) + (-13) + (-5) + 13 = 7\r\n\r\nMean = 7/8\r\n\r\nNow compute each squared deviation (xᵢ - mean)²:\r\n\r\n- 9 - 7/8 = 65/8, squared: 4225/64\r\n- 14 - 7/8 = 105/8, squared: 11025/64\r\n- 5 - 7/8 = 33/8, squared: 1089/64\r\n- 4 - 7/8 = 25/8, squared: 625/64\r\n- -20 - 7/8 = -167/8, squared: 27889/64\r\n- -13 - 7/8 = -111/8, squared: 12321/64\r\n- -5 - 7/8 = -47/8, squared: 2209/64\r\n- 13 - 7/8 = 97/8, squared: 9409/64\r\n\r\nSum of squared deviations:\r\n(4225 + 11025 + 1089 + 625 + 27889 + 12321 + 2209 + 9409)/64\r\n\r\n= (4225 + 11025 + 1089 + 625 + 27889 + 12321 + 2209 + 9409)/64\r\n\r\nLet me add:\r\n4225 + 11025 = 15250\r\n15250 + 1089 = 16339\r\n16339 + 625 = 16964\r\n16964 + 27889 = 44853\r\n44853 + 12321 = 57174\r\n57174 + 2209 = 59383\r\n59383 + 9409 = 68792\r\n\r\nSum = 68792/64\r\n\r\nSample variance = (68792/64) / (8-1) = 68792/(64 × 7) = 68792/448\r\n\r\nSimplify: GCD(68792, 448)\r\n448 = 64 × 7\r\n68792 / 8 = 8599\r\n448 / 8 = 56\r\nSo = 8599/56\r\n\r\nCheck if 8599 and 56 share common factors: 56 = 8 × 7\r\n8599 / 7 = 1228.43... not integer\r\n8599 is odd, so not divisible by 2.\r\n\r\nThus the sample variance is 8599/56.\r\n\r\n$\\boxed{\\dfrac{8599}{56}}$\r\n","path":"responses/claude-sonnet-4-6/livebench-052-math.txt","size":1159,"mtime":1779367871}